{
  "bookId": "hero-214103",
  "id": "bond-41104",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41104001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "Welcome to搬家感谢派对的说！来，请坐在这里！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "谢谢库特邀请我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "嘿嘿，因为准确来说这是为你专门举办的派对哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "诶？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "「非常感谢你愿意让我住在这么wonderful的家里」——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "是包含这样的感谢而举办的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "但其实就是菜品分享会啦，都是我自己做的……要是能合你口味就好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "41104009",
              "text": "所有菜品看上去都好美味！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "41104009",
              "text": "光是看着就要流口水了……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "41104008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "没想到能受到这样的盛赞，反而感觉very shy了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这可是真心的称赞。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "库特只需要自豪地收下称赞就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "那这个时候就应该说thank you very much的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "手办的大家还告诉我了很多菜谱，我想都试试！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "到时候，要是你愿意来帮我试试味道就好了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然！我很期待库特的新菜品。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41104018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "那现在就朝着厨房go的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
